  "final_message": "Fixed. The bug was in `due_for_retry` in `billing/dunning.py`. The tests pass and ruff is clean.\n\nThe filter was `status == \"open\" or (next_attempt_at is not None and next_attempt_at <= now)`. Because `or` is looser than `and`, every open invoice was retried on each billing run, whether or not its scheduled retry time had arrived. The fix requires all three conditions: the invoice is open, a retry is scheduled, and the retry time has passed.\n\nI didn't add a regression test, and I didn't reproduce the 8-versus-4 attempt count. I wrote `answer.json` with `{\"file\": \"dunning.py\", \"function\": \"due_for_retry\"}`.",
